Config override priorities:
    - CommandLine > ProjectSettings > System Default

Object Life Cycle:
    - PreInit
    - Init
    - PostInit
    - PreUpdate
    - Update
    - FixedUpdate
    - Terminate

External Vendor/Tools Folder:
    - Bin
    - Include
    - Libs
    - Source

Philosophies:
    - One job, one class, one method. Don't have multiple ways to do the same task
    - Compilation speed, size on disk, runtime performance, and memory usage are all important